.TH WELL\-MIGRATE 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 86590d34" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
well\-migrate \- Apply the Well's SQL migrations from the manifest, with a ledger (ADR\-101).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B well\-migrate
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
check | status | apply [\-db D] [\-yes] | baseline [\-db D] \-through FILE \-yes
.SH DESCRIPTION
Apply the Well's SQL migrations from the manifest, with a ledger (ADR\-101).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-dir \fISTRING\fR
migrations directory (holds MANIFEST and LEDGER.sql) (default db/migrations)
.TP
.B \-\-lock\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
lock wait limit inside each migration (default 5s)
.TP
.B \-\-statement\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
limit per statement (default 5m0s)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
